correctness[broad-catch]: `catch` handles every error
 --> positive.jl:4:5
  |
4 |     catch
  |     ^^^^^ no type test, no rethrow
  |
  = why: typos, `MethodError` and `InterruptException` vanish with intended errors
  = fix: handle expected type only: `e isa MyError || rethrow()`   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain broad-catch

